<title>HUNGARY: HORIZON-MULTIPLAN WIDENS LOSS IN H1.</title>
<headline>HORIZON-MULTIPLAN WIDENS LOSS IN H1.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
